    <!-- CASE STUDY X5 -->
    <section id="case-x5" class="card">
      <div class="label">Case Study</div>
      <h2>X5 — KOL Campaign for New RTD Beverage Launch</h2>
      <p class="p">
        Context: RTD crowded space (Pocari, Le Minerale, Hydro Coco). X5 menang bukan lewat out-spend,
        tapi out-relate. Gen Z & Millennials (18–35) lebih percaya orang daripada brand.
      </p>

      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="card soft">
          <div class="label">Big Idea</div>
          <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:8px;">“Your Vibe, Your X5.”</h2>
          <p class="p">
            X5 hadir di momen yang “defining”: post-gym, rooftop hangout, study grind, beach weekend.
            Setiap KOL punya versi X5-nya sendiri → brand terasa multi-dimensional & lived-in.
          </p>

          <div style="margin-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:14px;">
            <div class="label">Funnel Strategy</div>
            <table class="tbl" style="margin-top:10px;">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Stage</th>
                  <th>Driver</th>
                  <th>Objective</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Awareness</strong></td>
                  <td class="muted">Macro KOLs</td>
                  <td class="muted">Reach & visibility</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Affinity</strong></td>
                  <td class="muted">Mid-tier</td>
                  <td class="muted">Lifestyle storytelling & trust</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><strong>Activation</strong></td>
                  <td class="muted">Micro + Nano</td>
                  <td class="muted">UGC & trial drive</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card soft">
          <div class="label">Targets & Outcome (Week 8)</div>
          <table class="tbl">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Metric</th>
                <th class="num">Expected</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="muted">Incremented engagement rate (weighted avg)</td>
                <td class="num"><strong>5–8%</strong></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="muted">Estimated total reach (conservative)</td>
                <td class="num"><strong>2.5M+</strong></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="muted">Total content pieces (all platforms)</td>
                <td class="num"><strong>90+</strong></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>

          <div style="margin-top:14px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:14px;">
            <div class="label">Why this mix works</div>
            <p class="p">
              Budget Rp 500jt “terasa besar” tapi cepat habis kalau fokus celebrity.
              Arsitektur tier memastikan macro memberi momentum, sementara authenticity & volume datang dari micro–nano.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

